    "body": "## Motivation\n\nDeepGEMM compile-all warmup stops reducing its buffer size at `M=2048`, even when a smaller requested shape would fit. If the smallest requested shape cannot fit, attempting the allocation still risks a startup OOM.\n\n## Modifications\n\nContinue halving the buffer size down to the smallest requested M. Skip compile-all warmup if that minimum exceeds the available-memory estimate; first use may still JIT the uncached shape. Preserve main's compile lock and current-device memory query, kernel selection and cache keys.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n5 CPU tests passed, covering reduced allocation, skipping an oversized minimum and symmetric-memory context restoration. The regression exercises reduction below the 2048 floor. GPU startup warmup has not been tested.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nOnly affects compile-all warmup. A skipped shape may compile on first use. No startup-duration benchmark was run.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format changed code.\n- [x] Run regression tests described above.\n\n## Review and Merge Process\n\n1. Ping Merge Oncalls to start the process. See the [PR Merge Process](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.github/MAINTAINER.md#pull-request-merge-process).\n2. Get approvals from [CODEOWNERS](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.github/CODEOWNERS) and other reviewers.\n3. Trigger CI tests with [comments](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#how-to-trigger-ci-tests) or contact authorized users to do so.\n   - Common commands include `/tag-and-rerun-ci`, `/tag-run-ci-label`, `/rerun-failed-ci`\n4. After green CI and required approvals, ask Merge Oncalls or people with Write permission to merge the PR.\n\nDeveloped with AI assistance.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37577724631](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37577724631)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37577724516](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37577724516)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37577724488](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37577724488)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->\n",
